+/* ------------------------------------------------------------ MMX (no prefix 0F xx, and the SSSE3 forms of 0F 38 / 0F 3A)
+ * mm0-mm7 live in c->mm. On real hardware they alias the x87 registers; here they are separate, which is only visible to code
